sentences.text:
A glance of order dated 25.11.2023, which is placed on record as Annexure P-1, would demonstrate that prior to filing of application under Section 311 CrPC, the victim and her father submitted an application under Section 320 (2), 320 (4) & 320( 8) of the CrPC along with affidavit,
for compounding of offence and said application came to be rejected on the ground that the offence under Section 363, 366, 376 (2)
(n) of IPC and Section 5l/6 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012, for which applicant is facing trial, are non- compoundable.
